# Loyalty staff UI system

Source of truth: `docs/guides/LOYALTY_STAFF_UI.md`.  
Architecture gate: `pnpm check:architecture:loyalty-staff-ui` (part of `validate:ci`).

When **planning or implementing** staff pages under `apps/loyalty/src/app/(dashboard)/`:

1. Wrap the page in `PageShell` from `@/components/dashboard` (`narrow` only for Counter-like ops).
2. Use `PageHeader` for title + one-line subtitle + `size="sm"` actions.
3. Use shared primitives: `GuideCard`, `StatStrip`, `FilterTabs`, `EmptyState`, `ConfirmDialog`, `PermissionGate`.
4. Do not add page-local EmptyState / ConfirmActionDialog copies or one-off confirm overlays.
5. Do not use `window.confirm()` / `confirm()` — use `ConfirmDialog`.
6. Do not add extra full-page padding (`space-y-8`, nested `p-*`) that fights `space-y-5 pb-10`.
7. Section titles inside cards use `CardTitle` with `text-base`, not oversized headings.
8. Counter and Overview are documented **variants** of this system — same primitives, different density — not free-form layouts.
9. New plans that add or change staff UI must cite `LOYALTY_STAFF_UI.md` and reuse these primitives — do not invent a parallel layout recipe.

Public marketing/portal and `apps/admin` are out of scope for these primitives unless explicitly adopting the same guide.
